    "media:imagetext": "• menu\nCover Design\nby Lillian Sader.\nOne of America's leading\nyoung arlists, Miss Sader\ncombines a deft color touch\nwith a sensitive flair\nfor intricate design.\nFor Hawaii,\nshe has created\na unique tableau of\nthese famous Hawaiian attractions—\nDiamond Head\nSurfing and Canoeing at Waikiki\nNative Fisherman\nStatue of King Kamehameha\nA Hula Dancer, Palm Trees\nPineapples\nand Various Hawaiian Plants\nComplete set of menus\nsuitable for framing may be\nobtained upon request\nPAN AMERICAN WORLD AIRWAYS G\nPRINTED IN U.S. A.",
